# Anything not needed to build or run the server.
#
# AGENT §5 forbids committing `.env`, `dist/`, `src/generated/` and uploaded
# media; this keeps them out of the build context too, so a stray local file
# can never reach an image layer. `.env` is the one that matters: a secret baked
# into a layer survives every later `rm`.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
dist
.astro
src/generated
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
.playwright
docs
e2e
*.md
!README.md
